  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>The adidas Argentina Handball Spezial is a nod to the past with a flair for the present. Originally launched in the ‚Äò70s for indoor sports, these shoes have evolved into a lifestyle staple. Crafted with a supple suede upper, they offer a premium feel that complements their classic design. The soft gum rubber outsole keeps them true to their vintage roots, offering both style and comfort. With the iconic 3-Stripes and OG Spezial branding on the quarter and tongue, these shoes make a statement. Their regular fit and lace closure provide a snug and comfortable fit, a great choice for everyday wear. Whether you‚Äôre hitting the streets or reminiscing about the golden era of handball, these shoes are your go-to selection. Embrace the adidas legacy and step out in style with the adidas Argentina Handball Spezial.</p> <ul> <li>Suede upper offers durability and comfort.</li> <li>Soft gum rubber outsole ensures traction.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Easy to wear and rooted in adidas heritage, the adidas Argentina Handball Spezial brings vintage indoor sport style into your everyday rotation. The low-profile silhouette, premium suede upper, and gum rubber outsole stay true to the original, while Argentina-inspired details give this pair a distinctive finish that stands out on the street.</p><ul><li>Suede upper offers a soft, premium feel.</li><li>Lace closure lets you fine-tune the fit.</li><li>Gum rubber outsole delivers classic traction and retro appeal.</li><li>Spezial branding and Argentina-inspired details complete the look.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Reviewers consistently call this pair comfortable, with many noting a slightly roomy fit. For the best fit, we recommend your usual size for casual wear, or a half-size down if you are between sizes or prefer a closer, more secure feel.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for everyday wear, long walks, and versatile styling with everything from jeans and shorts to more polished casual looks.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p><p>This is the kind of sneaker that works across your whole rotation. Reviewers love the timeless shape, vintage gum sole, and easy-to-style design that pairs just as well with laid-back outfits as it does with sport-inspired or dressed-up casual fits.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say comfort is there from the start, while some note the fit gets even better after a few wears as the materials soften and conform. The suede upper and gum sole also earn praise for their quality feel in regular rotation.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas  Argentina Handball Spezial - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Blue/Black/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>HP3673</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12